WEBVTT

00:00:13.190 --> 00:00:16.340
"Rokkon sho jo..." (purify the six senses).

00:00:16.340 --> 00:00:22.820
"Rokkon sho jo..."

00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:25.450
What's "rokkon sho jo"?

00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:27.990
You chant it whenever you're 
climbing up a mountain path.

00:00:27.990 --> 00:00:30.240
It's like a magic spell.

00:00:32.030 --> 00:00:33.560
There it is...

00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:36.040
That zelkova tree is the top of the hill.

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:41.700
It's so pretty! There are stars below, too.

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:44.050
It's like the sky and the 
ground are connected.

00:00:44.050 --> 00:00:46.370
No matter how hard a hill you have to climb,

00:00:46.370 --> 00:00:49.990
what you'll find beyond that 
is always a beautiful sight.

00:00:49.990 --> 00:00:54.950
You must never lose hope, Sanae.

00:01:11.420 --> 00:01:14.020
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:14.020 --> 00:01:16.820
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:16.820 --> 00:01:19.660
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:19.660 --> 00:01:23.930
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are...</i>

00:01:23.930 --> 00:01:26.900
<i>PRETTY CURE...!</i>

00:01:26.900 --> 00:01:29.770
<i>Out of the frying pan, into the fire</i>

00:01:29.770 --> 00:01:31.670
<i>Frankly, it's totally unbelievable</i>

00:01:32.870 --> 00:01:35.570
<i>Even in our school in our 
school uniforms, we're both</i>

00:01:35.570 --> 00:01:37.180
<i>amazingly tough</i>

00:01:38.680 --> 00:01:42.980
<i>Each time we get out of a tight spot, we both</i>

00:01:43.610 --> 00:01:45.080
<i>become stronger</i>

00:01:45.080 --> 00:01:48.850
<i>and closer</i>

00:01:49.850 --> 00:01:52.860
<i>Yeah! Your best! My best! Because we're alive</i>

00:01:52.860 --> 00:01:55.430
<i>we never fail!</i>

00:01:55.690 --> 00:01:58.600
<i>Don't you know that good fortune 
comes to the gates of laughter?</i>

00:01:58.600 --> 00:02:01.470
<i>Out with the negative!</i>

00:02:01.470 --> 00:02:07.740
<i>Brighten up your life!
Try with all your might...</i>

00:02:07.740 --> 00:02:08.640
<i>Work like the devil!</i>

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:11.340
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:11.340 --> 00:02:14.150
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:14.150 --> 00:02:17.050
<i>We're pretty and cure cure</i>

00:02:17.050 --> 00:02:18.620
<i>Together we are</i>

00:02:18.620 --> 00:02:21.690
<i>Pretty Cure...!</i>

00:02:33.310 --> 00:02:35.560
It wasn't the same as it was before...

00:02:36.950 --> 00:02:40.800
We don't know what he was thinking 
or what he was trying to do.

00:02:41.270 --> 00:02:43.610
Was he reincarnation of Jyaku-King?

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:45.630
What comes after that?

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:53.610
Whatever it is, something is definitely 
happening around us again.

00:02:54.320 --> 00:02:55.280
Never mind that...

00:02:55.530 --> 00:02:57.980
It's hot!

00:02:57.160 --> 00:02:59.410
The fan is on.

00:02:59.410 --> 00:03:00.790
It's not enough.

00:03:00.790 --> 00:03:04.410
Try not to let skin touch skin,

00:03:04.410 --> 00:03:07.380
and open up as much area 
on your body as possible,

00:03:07.380 --> 00:03:11.300
it'll take away the heat of 
vaporization, and you'll feel cooler.

00:03:13.290 --> 00:03:14.380
Like this?

00:03:14.380 --> 00:03:15.070
That's right.

00:03:15.470 --> 00:03:17.900
I feel like a frog. I hate this.

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:22.020
This feels so good.

00:03:22.020 --> 00:03:25.260
But eventually, the comforter will 
get warm from your body temperature,

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:27.580
and you won't be able to bear it.

00:03:27.860 --> 00:03:28.720
It's hot!

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:34.320
Let's hurry, and finish this.

00:03:36.650 --> 00:03:39.170
We still have two weeks left 
of our summer vacation,

00:03:39.170 --> 00:03:40.910
so why don't we go out for snow cones?

00:03:40.910 --> 00:03:44.130
Don't blame me if you start 
crying when you run out of time.

00:03:44.130 --> 00:03:46.640
I'm always crying on the 
last day of vacation,

00:03:46.640 --> 00:03:49.140
and doing my homework.

00:03:49.140 --> 00:03:50.200
I'll bet you are.

00:03:50.630 --> 00:03:52.790
Mipo! Mipo! Mipo! Mipo...!

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:54.350
Popo! Popo! Popo! Popo...!

00:03:54.600 --> 00:03:56.670
Mipo...!

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:59.520
Popo... popo... popo...

00:03:59.520 --> 00:04:00.600
You're "It" mepo!

00:04:03.090 --> 00:04:05.010
Mepple hit me popo...!

00:04:05.930 --> 00:04:07.900
I just tagged you mepo!

00:04:07.900 --> 00:04:10.760
And besides, where did you 
learn that anyway mepo?

00:04:10.760 --> 00:04:12.960
Never mind! Pollun's "It" now mepo.

00:04:12.960 --> 00:04:15.120
Why popo?

00:04:15.120 --> 00:04:16.920
That's the rule of "onigokko" 
(game of tag)...

00:04:16.920 --> 00:04:18.370
I don't want to be "It" popo.

00:04:18.370 --> 00:04:20.680
Then how do you expect 
to play "onigokko" mepo?

00:04:20.680 --> 00:04:23.700
Mipple! Mepple is picking on me popo.

00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:28.350
Why does it always turn out like this mepo?

00:04:28.350 --> 00:04:30.440
Let's play something else then mipo.

00:04:30.440 --> 00:04:32.600
You're too easy on Pollun mepo, Mipple.

00:04:32.600 --> 00:04:34.320
I'm tired of playing "onigokko" popo.

00:04:34.320 --> 00:04:36.670
Let's play "daruma-san ga koronda" 
(Red Light, Green Light) popo.

00:04:36.670 --> 00:04:39.420
I'm surprised you know a game like that.

00:04:39.420 --> 00:04:42.030
We're going to keep playing "onigokko" 
with Pollun as "It" mepo.

00:04:42.030 --> 00:04:46.710
"Daruma-san ga koronda" popo!
 "Daruma-san ga koronda" popo!

00:04:45.980 --> 00:04:47.690
We're playing "onigokko" mepo!

00:04:47.690 --> 00:04:49.830
"Daruma-san ga koronda" popo!

00:04:49.430 --> 00:04:50.630
"Onigokko" mepo!

00:04:50.630 --> 00:04:52.610
"Daruma-san" popo!

00:04:52.610 --> 00:04:53.890
"Oni-san" mepo!

00:04:55.450 --> 00:05:02.250
Popo... popo... popo...

00:04:57.170 --> 00:05:02.250
Mepo... mepo... mepo...

00:05:02.250 --> 00:05:03.380
That's enough!

00:05:03.380 --> 00:05:05.260
Be quiet!

00:05:06.980 --> 00:05:09.400
You're making the most noise, Nagisa mepo.

00:05:09.400 --> 00:05:10.670
What?

00:05:10.670 --> 00:05:11.670
He's right popo.

00:05:11.670 --> 00:05:13.440
Is that any way for Pretty Cula to act popo.

00:05:13.440 --> 00:05:14.980
It's not "cula" it's cure."

00:05:14.980 --> 00:05:16.300
It's PRETTY CURE!

00:05:16.300 --> 00:05:17.750
That's what I said... Pretty Cula.

00:05:25.770 --> 00:05:30.340
"REGINE APPEARS! 
WE'VE HAD ENOUGH OF THIS ALREADY"

00:06:00.840 --> 00:06:04.460
"Daruma-san ga koronda" mepo!

00:06:06.630 --> 00:06:08.610
"Daruma-san ga koronda" mepo.

00:06:09.670 --> 00:06:10.810
Pollun mepo!

00:06:10.810 --> 00:06:12.490
Why me popo?

00:06:12.490 --> 00:06:14.060
You moved mepo.

00:06:14.060 --> 00:06:15.530
I didn't move popo.

00:06:15.530 --> 00:06:17.220
You definitely moved mepo.

00:06:17.220 --> 00:06:18.720
I did not move popo!

00:06:18.720 --> 00:06:32.190
I did not move popo! I did not move popo!

00:06:20.280 --> 00:06:21.830
He's at it again mepo.

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:24.790
This is going to take a long time.

00:06:25.140 --> 00:06:30.270
Pollun's still a little kid, so 
just give him one more chance mipo.

00:06:30.420 --> 00:06:33.730
That defeats the whole 
purpose of the game mepo!

00:06:34.190 --> 00:06:37.790
Besides, the way Mepple plays 
"daruma-san ga "koronda," he doesn't count till ten,

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:40.870
so he's not following the rules 
of the game to begin with.

00:06:40.870 --> 00:06:43.650
he's not following the rules 
of the game to begin with.

00:06:43.970 --> 00:06:45.700
Did you say something mepo?

00:06:47.560 --> 00:06:50.720
Where did you come from?

00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:55.540
It's okay because the Field of Light 
is based on a duodecimal system mepo.

00:06:55.540 --> 00:06:56.240
Really?

00:06:55.540 --> 00:06:56.690
Just kidding mepo.

00:06:56.690 --> 00:06:57.800
That was fast.

00:06:58.660 --> 00:07:02.520
Never mind that. Be quiet. 
I can't concentrate.

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:03.830
I don't want to mepo.

00:07:04.570 --> 00:07:06.930
Is this any time for you to 
throw your weight around?

00:07:06.930 --> 00:07:08.140
They're waking up popo.

00:07:08.140 --> 00:07:09.130
What?

00:07:09.130 --> 00:07:10.020
Mepo?

00:07:10.540 --> 00:07:12.140
They're waking up popo.

00:07:12.300 --> 00:07:13.850
Red popo.

00:07:13.850 --> 00:07:16.290
The red bridge is dangerous popo.

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:17.350
The red bridge?

00:07:46.670 --> 00:07:48.170
The red bridge?

00:07:48.350 --> 00:07:49.920
What is he talking about?

00:07:49.920 --> 00:07:54.150
Queen said Pollun has special powers mipo.

00:07:54.410 --> 00:07:56.360
Come to think of it, the last time...

00:07:57.130 --> 00:07:58.720
They're waking up popo.

00:07:59.480 --> 00:08:01.540
And that guy appeared.

00:08:01.860 --> 00:08:06.300
Does that mean that Pollun's power 
is the ability to foresee things?

00:08:06.570 --> 00:08:10.410
If that's the case, does that mean 
that something will happen again?

00:08:11.250 --> 00:08:13.530
I don't want to think about it.

00:08:13.940 --> 00:08:16.490
Will we be able to do it?

00:08:17.620 --> 00:08:22.180
Doesn't it mean that someone 
like that guy will appear again?

00:08:22.670 --> 00:08:26.180
Do you really think that we're strong enough?

00:08:26.450 --> 00:08:27.780
Nagisa...?

00:08:28.220 --> 00:08:30.140
How long will this go on?

00:08:30.460 --> 00:08:33.440
Fighting against people 
who baffle the mind...

00:08:33.440 --> 00:08:35.800
Protecting Mepple, Mipple and Pollun.

00:08:35.800 --> 00:08:37.470
Protecting the Prism Stones.

00:08:37.470 --> 00:08:40.910
Protecting the Field of Light 
and this Field of Rainbows.

00:08:41.600 --> 00:08:43.810
When will it ever end?

00:08:43.810 --> 00:08:47.320
Are we are really strong 
enough to last until then?

00:08:47.820 --> 00:08:51.440
Do we really have that kind of power?

00:08:51.440 --> 00:08:53.920
No matter how hard we try,

00:08:53.920 --> 00:08:57.610
this world will be annihilated 
by Dotsuku Zone...!

00:08:57.610 --> 00:08:58.410
Stop it!

00:09:01.380 --> 00:09:04.330
I don't want to hear this.

00:09:04.950 --> 00:09:05.850
I'm...

00:09:06.340 --> 00:09:09.540
I'm already so full of doubts 
that I can't bear it.

00:09:09.920 --> 00:09:14.420
If you weren't with me, I'd fall apart.

00:09:14.880 --> 00:09:17.180
I'm sorry... I wasn't thinking...

00:09:17.180 --> 00:09:20.830
Don't worry... The Field 
of Light, and this world

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:22.890
will go on like this.

00:09:22.890 --> 00:09:25.550
You're right... We'll go 
on like this, won't we?

00:09:25.550 --> 00:09:26.340
Besides...

00:09:26.650 --> 00:09:30.910
...it's no use thinking about it.

00:09:32.610 --> 00:09:33.500
Mepo!

00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:34.120
Mipo!

00:09:35.330 --> 00:09:37.880
Are you finished studying?

00:09:37.880 --> 00:09:40.190
Have some cold barley tea.

00:09:41.490 --> 00:09:43.640
What's wrong?

00:09:43.640 --> 00:09:46.650
The two of you look so pale.

00:09:46.650 --> 00:09:48.140
It's nothing.

00:09:48.490 --> 00:09:50.130
Thank you.

00:09:50.300 --> 00:09:51.750
If you say so...

00:09:53.610 --> 00:09:55.570
It's no use anyway...

00:09:55.750 --> 00:09:59.040
We can't do anything about it now.

00:10:01.230 --> 00:10:04.610
Sometimes if you think you 
can't do anything about it,

00:10:04.610 --> 00:10:08.560
you won't be able to do anything.

00:10:10.070 --> 00:10:13.780
And you get more and more doubtful.

00:10:14.830 --> 00:10:16.080
Grandmother...?

00:10:17.740 --> 00:10:22.330
Then, haven't you ever thought that there 
was nothing you could do about something?

00:10:22.330 --> 00:10:24.730
Of course... many times.

00:10:24.730 --> 00:10:25.810
For example?

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:29.170
When I fell down during a race...

00:10:29.170 --> 00:10:32.100
When my grades were bad on a test...

00:10:32.320 --> 00:10:35.840
And when this town was gone.

00:10:37.840 --> 00:10:39.300
This town...

00:10:40.230 --> 00:10:41.810
...was gone?

00:11:14.560 --> 00:11:17.920
It was when I was about your age...

00:11:17.920 --> 00:11:20.500
No... maybe a little younger than that.

00:11:20.500 --> 00:11:23.100
Everything burned down 
except half of this house,

00:11:23.100 --> 00:11:25.560
and one of the storehouses...

00:11:25.560 --> 00:11:27.060
Burned down...?

00:11:27.060 --> 00:11:28.330
By any chance was it...?

00:11:28.630 --> 00:11:31.550
That's right. It was right 
after the war ended,

00:11:31.550 --> 00:11:34.200
and it took all the effort 
we had just to stay alive.

00:11:34.200 --> 00:11:37.100
One day, I remembered something...

00:11:37.660 --> 00:11:42.140
The hill with the zelkova tree 
that my father had taken me to.

00:11:42.760 --> 00:11:47.650
Maybe somewhere deep down in my heart, 
I was trying to cheer myself up.

00:11:47.920 --> 00:11:53.880
I don't know when she started following me,

00:11:53.870 --> 00:11:58.380
but she wouldn't go home.

00:11:58.620 --> 00:12:00.540
I still don't know if she 
had a place to go home to

00:12:00.540 --> 00:12:02.610
because no matter what I asked 
her, she wouldn't answer.

00:12:02.900 --> 00:12:07.310
I guess maybe I was lonely 
being by myself, too.

00:12:07.310 --> 00:12:18.480
"Rokkon sho jo."

00:12:10.140 --> 00:12:12.760
It was a strange day...

00:12:12.760 --> 00:12:17.270
One by one, the children 
started following me.

00:12:23.450 --> 00:12:26.080
After that, it was like 
going on an excursion.

00:12:26.420 --> 00:12:43.310
"Rokkon sho jo."

00:12:37.510 --> 00:12:39.930
And it finally appeared...

00:12:39.930 --> 00:12:43.300
There were leaves growing on the branches

00:12:43.300 --> 00:12:45.770
that were left of that zelkova 
tree that was still standing.

00:12:46.260 --> 00:12:49.960
I don't know what I was expecting...

00:12:49.960 --> 00:12:52.250
But the town that I looked 
down upon from that hill...

00:12:53.690 --> 00:12:57.150
Actually... there was no town left.

00:12:57.850 --> 00:13:01.260
It was just a pile of rubble 
as far as the eye could see.

00:13:01.880 --> 00:13:04.490
No matter how hard a hill you have to climb,

00:13:04.490 --> 00:13:08.190
what you'll find beyond that 
is always a beautiful sight.

00:13:08.480 --> 00:13:09.790
Liar...

00:13:14.150 --> 00:13:15.640
Liar!

00:13:23.260 --> 00:13:26.750
But just then I heard it...

00:13:26.750 --> 00:13:28.280
I heard it clearly...

00:13:33.100 --> 00:13:35.590
You mustn't give up hope mipo.

00:13:37.840 --> 00:13:40.760
You're right... I forgot.

00:13:51.590 --> 00:13:52.620
That's right...

00:13:52.960 --> 00:13:56.020
No matter what happens, 
you mustn't lose hope.

00:13:59.020 --> 00:14:04.150
No matter how hard or painful it is now...

00:14:04.150 --> 00:14:06.630
You mustn't give up hope.

00:14:07.020 --> 00:14:11.800
As long as you don't lose hope, 
tomorrow will be a good day.

00:14:12.770 --> 00:14:16.570
Despair and hope are back to back.

00:14:16.910 --> 00:14:19.520
Despair and hope are back to back?

00:14:19.520 --> 00:14:21.130
It's the first time I heard that...

00:14:21.470 --> 00:14:24.350
Why didn't you tell me this until now?

00:14:24.350 --> 00:14:29.570
Because we never talked 
about this before, did we?

00:14:29.570 --> 00:14:31.740
You never asked me...

00:14:31.740 --> 00:14:33.820
I know, but...

00:14:33.820 --> 00:14:36.770
I forgot to bring you some 
sweets for your tea...

00:14:36.770 --> 00:14:38.720
I'll be right back.

00:14:39.400 --> 00:14:41.020
Here you go...

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:42.720
"Ujikintoki" (green tea snow cones 
with ice cream and azuki beans).

00:14:42.720 --> 00:14:44.700
And a Nagisa special... Chocolate milk.

00:14:44.700 --> 00:14:45.830
Looks delicious.

00:14:45.830 --> 00:14:46.790
Really?

00:14:47.460 --> 00:14:50.560
So you started selling snow cones, Akane-san.

00:14:50.560 --> 00:14:52.900
In order to survive in this failing economy,

00:14:52.900 --> 00:14:56.420
you have to answer the needs of the 
customers as quickly as possible.

00:14:56.980 --> 00:15:01.600
But they're selling snow 
cones everywhere now...

00:15:01.600 --> 00:15:04.340
It's not doing as well as I thought.

00:15:05.190 --> 00:15:08.350
This is bad! I'm complaining 
to my underclassmen now.

00:15:08.700 --> 00:15:14.720
No matter how bad the economy is in 
the world, you mustn't lose hope.

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:20.000
As long as you have hope, tomorrow 
is sure to be a better day.

00:15:20.000 --> 00:15:21.930
Are you okay, Nagisa?

00:15:21.930 --> 00:15:23.190
Why?

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:24.610
That's a good thing to say.

00:15:25.340 --> 00:15:27.370
Do you have a fever, or something?

00:15:28.080 --> 00:15:29.070
Let's eat, Honoka.

00:15:32.110 --> 00:15:35.280
Tomorrow is sure to be a better day.

00:15:38.970 --> 00:15:41.390
Shall we go, and see the 
hill with the zelkova tree?

00:15:41.560 --> 00:15:45.950
It's okay with me, but you didn't 
even want to move earlier.

00:15:46.480 --> 00:15:49.030
After eating the snow 
cones, I feel refreshed.

00:15:49.760 --> 00:15:50.800
Let's go.

00:15:52.960 --> 00:15:54.680
I wish I hadn't suggested it...

00:15:54.680 --> 00:15:55.880
It's quite a long walk.

00:15:55.880 --> 00:15:59.760
It's a promenade now, so it feels nice.

00:16:00.250 --> 00:16:02.510
I shouldn't have come.

00:16:02.510 --> 00:16:05.040
I want to eat another snow cone.

00:16:13.260 --> 00:16:14.860
I wonder what's wrong?

00:16:14.860 --> 00:16:16.690
She's been staring at us all this time.

00:16:16.690 --> 00:16:17.550
Do you know her?

00:16:17.550 --> 00:16:18.370
Not at all.

00:16:22.590 --> 00:16:24.330
They're waking up popo.

00:16:24.870 --> 00:16:26.710
They're waking up popo. 
They're waking up popo.

00:16:26.710 --> 00:16:27.830
Watch out popo!

00:16:27.830 --> 00:16:28.830
Which means...?

00:16:28.830 --> 00:16:30.030
Don't tell me you're...?

00:16:35.950 --> 00:16:36.710
Wait!

00:16:36.710 --> 00:16:37.590
Where are you going?

00:16:41.110 --> 00:16:43.120
Be careful, Nagisa mepo!

00:16:43.120 --> 00:16:44.810
They're Zakennas mepo!

00:16:44.810 --> 00:16:46.100
I'm scared popo.

00:16:46.260 --> 00:16:47.910
Then she's...

00:16:47.910 --> 00:16:49.050
...from Dotsuku Zone!

00:16:51.500 --> 00:16:52.500
Honoka!

00:16:57.400 --> 00:17:00.440
Dual Aurora Wave!

00:17:07.260 --> 00:17:09.720
Protector of the Light, Cure Black!

00:17:10.030 --> 00:17:12.380
Protector of the Light, Cure White!

00:17:14.420 --> 00:17:16.150
Together, we're Pretty Cure!

00:17:17.510 --> 00:17:19.550
Servants of the power of darkness...

00:17:20.520 --> 00:17:22.990
Go back to where you came from!

00:17:42.830 --> 00:17:46.210
Zakenna!

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:51.960
Zakenna!

00:18:08.680 --> 00:18:09.400
Zakenna!

00:18:12.370 --> 00:18:14.190
White! That...

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:22.010
I see... I thought today's 
Zakennas were somehow different.

00:18:22.010 --> 00:18:23.380
They were full of spirit...

00:18:24.030 --> 00:18:26.150
They were protecting her.

00:19:05.020 --> 00:19:05.910
Pretty Cure...

00:19:10.490 --> 00:19:11.570
That's...

00:19:11.570 --> 00:19:12.400
...the guy from the other day.

00:19:12.620 --> 00:19:16.260
You have a job to do first...

00:19:16.770 --> 00:19:19.100
Pretty Cure!

00:19:20.400 --> 00:19:21.370
Wait!

00:19:25.560 --> 00:19:26.940
You're kidding!

00:19:27.950 --> 00:19:30.040
What are we supposed to do now?

00:19:30.400 --> 00:19:32.910
It was hard enough with 
them just five of them...

00:19:33.450 --> 00:19:38.090
Wasn't there supposed to be a 
beautiful sight beyond the hill?

00:19:39.530 --> 00:19:40.920
It's impossible...

00:19:40.920 --> 00:19:42.000
I know it is!

00:19:42.940 --> 00:19:44.510
I've had enough!

00:19:45.180 --> 00:19:48.750
I don't have time to deal with you...

00:19:49.130 --> 00:19:53.390
Let me have a more normal summer vacation.

00:19:53.940 --> 00:19:54.960
Black...

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:58.650
I was really beginning to panic...

00:19:58.650 --> 00:20:03.550
If I don't hurry, Izumi-ya's 
chocolate tarts will sell out.

00:20:04.210 --> 00:20:06.050
It's a limited time item.

00:20:06.280 --> 00:20:07.930
Is that what you're talking about?

00:20:07.930 --> 00:20:12.490
I don't know if I can finish 
my homework or not now.

00:20:12.490 --> 00:20:15.420
If you do it everyday, you'll finish it.

00:20:15.610 --> 00:20:19.510
It takes me a while to get into it.

00:20:19.510 --> 00:20:22.810
So just go back to Dotsuku Zone already!

00:20:22.810 --> 00:20:24.480
You mean you've recovered?

00:20:24.480 --> 00:20:25.530
Let's go, White!

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:30.000
Do your best, Pretty Cula!

00:20:30.180 --> 00:20:31.600
It's CURE!

00:20:37.960 --> 00:20:41.110
Zakenna!

00:20:41.910 --> 00:20:43.630
Zakenna...!

00:21:16.930 --> 00:21:18.000
That...?

00:21:28.000 --> 00:21:29.050
That's...

00:21:29.050 --> 00:21:30.510
...the red bridge.

00:21:31.590 --> 00:21:33.370
Zakenna!

00:21:32.270 --> 00:21:34.370
Zakenna...!

00:21:34.700 --> 00:21:36.530
Zakenna!

00:21:37.100 --> 00:21:40.140
Gomenna! Gomenna! Gomenna!

00:21:40.140 --> 00:21:41.820
Gomenna! Gomenna!

00:21:43.330 --> 00:21:45.280
So you finally woke up.

00:21:47.430 --> 00:21:50.160
Good morning, Regine.

00:21:51.040 --> 00:21:52.820
What's going to happen now mipo?

00:21:52.820 --> 00:21:54.570
What are we going to do now mipo?

00:21:54.570 --> 00:21:55.770
Don't worry.

00:21:55.970 --> 00:21:58.230
What do you mean "don't worry" mepo?

00:21:58.480 --> 00:22:00.700
No matter how hard it may be now...

00:22:00.700 --> 00:22:03.690
Despair and hope are always back to back.

00:22:06.830 --> 00:22:09.270
As long as we don't give up hope...

00:22:09.660 --> 00:22:11.040
Tomorrow will surely be...

00:22:12.480 --> 00:22:14.010
...a better day.

00:22:22.220 --> 00:22:25.260
<i>Ah- Let's go!</i>

00:22:26.090 --> 00:22:29.190
<i>Get you! L-O-V-E Love Love!</i>

00:22:29.190 --> 00:22:29.930
<i>Get you!</i>

00:22:29.490 --> 00:22:32.530
<i>I can't do this! I'd rather be a</i>

00:22:32.530 --> 00:22:35.570
<i>young lady than a fighter and</i>

00:22:35.570 --> 00:22:38.100
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:42.140
<i>And melt your body and soul into sweets</i>

00:22:44.680 --> 00:22:47.910
<i>like chocolate parfait or handsome men</i>

00:22:47.910 --> 00:22:52.250
<i>I'm at the age to seriously 
fall head over heels in love</i>

00:22:52.250 --> 00:22:55.320
<i>I wanted to confess my love again today</i>

00:22:56.450 --> 00:22:59.820
<i>For the sake of the earth 
For the sake of everyone</i>

00:22:59.820 --> 00:23:06.330
<i>That's good, too, but haven't 
you forgotten something?</i>

00:23:07.430 --> 00:23:13.940
<i>I'm a teenager with a heart 
throbbing exciting dream</i>

00:23:13.940 --> 00:23:20.450
<i>I don't want to lose that 
normal everyday routine</i>

00:23:20.450 --> 00:23:23.180
<i>I just can't do this! 
It's romance rather than</i>

00:23:23.180 --> 00:23:26.420
<i>stress, isn't it?</i>

00:23:26.420 --> 00:23:28.590
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode.</i>

00:23:28.590 --> 00:23:32.190
<i>Isn't that the best source of power?</i>

00:23:32.190 --> 00:23:35.390
<i>I just can't do this! I'd rather cuddle</i>

00:23:35.390 --> 00:23:38.200
<i>than fight and...</i>

00:23:38.200 --> 00:23:40.430
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:23:40.430 --> 00:23:43.100
<i>That's the most peaceful way</i>

00:23:43.100 --> 00:23:49.670
<i>So why am I stuffing my face 
with chocolates like this?</i>

00:23:53.320 --> 00:23:54.360
Today is the summer festival...

00:23:54.360 --> 00:23:55.480
Everyone will test their courage.

00:23:55.480 --> 00:23:57.620
I'll be alone with Fuji-P...

00:23:57.620 --> 00:23:58.580
My heart's pounding.

00:23:58.580 --> 00:23:59.930
Watch out, Fujimura-kun!

00:23:59.930 --> 00:24:01.970
Fuji-P hurt his foot...

00:24:01.970 --> 00:24:02.870
We have to get him to a hospital quick.

00:24:02.870 --> 00:24:05.140
There's a sinister presence 
here in the hospital.

00:24:05.140 --> 00:24:07.240
Nagisa! That's the third dark warrior.

00:24:07.240 --> 00:24:09.470
I hope that's the last one!

00:24:10.700 --> 00:24:13.870
"STORMY SUMMER FESTIVAL! 
THE THUNDER GOD IS SUPER SCARY?!"

00:24:13.870 --> 00:24:14.800
The days of my youth...

00:24:14.800 --> 00:24:16.670
My special memories of Fuji-P...

00:24:17.020 --> 00:24:20.470
Stop thinking about it, 
and do something about it.
